morph.tsv.gz
  Derived from UniMorph Spanish (https://github.com/unimorph/spa), itself drawn
  from English Wiktionary. Licensed CC BY-SA 3.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/). This file is distributed
  under the same licence. Missing verbs were filled in with output from the
  verbecc conjugator (https://github.com/bretttolbert/verbecc, LGPL-3.0), used
  as a build-time tool only.

vocab.sample.tsv
  Hand-made illustrative sample. Ranks are approximate and for testing only.

grammar.yaml
  Level assignments follow the Instituto Cervantes Plan Curricular as adapted
  in this project's graded-sentences method.

vocab.tsv
  Ranks and parts of speech from Mark Davies, A Frequency Dictionary of Spanish
  (Routledge). Glosses and example sentences are deliberately omitted.
